### creating new repository
POST http://localhost:8080/api/repository/repo
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "private-repository-1",
    "description": "this is a private repository-1 created by user2",
    "visibility": "PRIVATE"
}

### getting repository by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/repository/repo/69fda601a63e1422a85c3453

### Searching repositories by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/repository/search?repoName=re

### Updating repository by id
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/repository/repo/69fda4b3a63e1422a85c3451
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "repo1",
    "description": "this is a public repo 1 created by user1",
    "visibility": "PUBLIC"
}

### Deleting repository by id
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/repository/repo/69fda54fa63e1422a85c3452

### getting all repositories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/repository/all-repos



